  pearl:'Dietary manipulation is a critical and often sufficient treatment — always trial a hypoallergenic diet before or alongside immunosuppression. Taper corticosteroids gradually — rapid taper causes relapse. Cats have more severe disease and poorer prognosis than dogs. Monitor CBC carefully with azathioprine or chlorambucil use.',
